  "name": "Disciplined Mind dispels every ally Benediction heals when Holy Cleave stacks heal a second ally",
  "contract": "Disciplined Mind rank 2 681483 ('causes it to dispel 2 poison and disease effects') casts 525052 at every unit Benediction 578276 hits, from templar_casts::OnSpellHitResult, once per 525052 trigger effect of the rank (ADR 0159, ADR 0293; owner ruling, status-5 Q1 option (a): Benediction dispels every ally it heals). Oath: Holy Cleave 804903 adds jump targets (aura 107 SPELLMOD_JUMP_TARGETS, family mask matching Benediction 578276), so Benediction cast at one grouped level 60 ally also heals a second. Both allies carry Frost Fever 55095, Blood Plague 55078, Deadly Poison 2818 and Mind-numbing Poison 25810. Two trials: both allies are healed once and both lose all four. Control: the same Holy Cleave stack without 681483, both allies are healed once and both keep all four.",
